   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SI Public Sector Innovation Programme is implemented in collaboration with universities and colleges. Financial support for organisations with capacity-enhancning training programs, focusing on Agenda 2030. The training programmes are for public sector employees and elected representatives from more than twenty OECD/DAC countries. The purpose is to strengthen the capacity of professionals to contribute to innovation in the public sector and support the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for sustainable development.</narrative>
